Chapter 1: Introduction to Natural Language Processing
 1.2   Applications of  Natural Language Understanding
- Two main applications:  
      +  Text based application;
      +  Dialogue based application
Text based application
- Retrieving appropriate documents on specific topics from text database;
-  Extracting  information from messages, articles on certain topics;
 - Translating documents from one language to another;     - Summarizing texts for specific purposes;
- Question Answering systems.
